      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm trying to figure something out for my business. we do some small-scale metal fabrication and i'm worried about these recent EPA carbon emission mandates. what are the actual consequences of these new rules for small industrial manufacturers like us?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
